From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:19:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3443/3799] soh: rename D_80A4FE3C -> sResetScale

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the unit scale it restores with it
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c
index f504c4933..28b09db07 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Gs/z_en_gs.c
@@ -515,7 +515,7 @@ void EnGs_Idle(EnGs* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnGs_ResetTransform(EnGs* this) {
     static Vec3s sResetRot = { 0, 0, 0 };  // was D_80A4FE34 [LLM:HIGH]
-    static Vec3f D_80A4FE3C = { 1.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f };
+    static Vec3f sResetScale = { 1.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f };  // was D_80A4FE3C [LLM:HIGH]
     s32 i;
 
     for (i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
@@ -523,7 +523,7 @@ void EnGs_ResetTransform(EnGs* this) {
     }
 
     for (i = 0; i < 2; i++) {
-        this->unk_1B4[i] = D_80A4FE3C;
+        this->unk_1B4[i] = sResetScale;  // was D_80A4FE3C [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 
     this->unk_19C = 3;
